   "text": "6  Check the graph and order it (ValidateAndOrder, :595)\n\n   dependsOn exists and is top-level; Kahn's sort puts ready steps\n   in declaration order; leftover steps mean a cycle; dependent\n   steps must name the same schema (:625) -> new YamlPipeline",
