  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "out_t",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900060,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900061,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "x": 1458,
   "y": 940.5,
   "width": 452.4,
   "height": 130.0,
   "text": "What comes out\n\nYamlPipeline: name, ordered top-level IStep list,\nthe pipeline engine and the first step's input schema.\n\nA YAML step and a C# step are both an IStep. An LlmStep\nwith an outputSchema returns a JsonStepResult, validated\nagainst the schema; a failure retries with the violations.",
   "originalText": "What comes out\n\nYamlPipeline: name, ordered top-level IStep list,\nthe pipeline engine and the first step's input schema.\n\nA YAML step and a C# step are both an IStep. An LlmStep\nwith an outputSchema returns a JsonStepResult, validated\nagainst the schema; a failure retries with the violations.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#5b21b6",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "why",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900062,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900063,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "#ecfdf5",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "x": 1440,
   "y": 160,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 149.75,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "why_t",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900064,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900065,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "x": 1458,
   "y": 178,
   "width": 460.2,
   "height": 113.75,
   "text": "Why there is no compilation\n\nA schema is a JsonSchema object in SchemaRegistry. The\nengine, middleware and telemetry see the same IStepResult\nwhether the step came from C# or from YAML. A new step\nkind is a type registered in IStepRegistry (an IExtension):\nthe factory has no list of kinds.",
   "originalText": "Why there is no compilation\n\nA schema is a JsonSchema object in SchemaRegistry. The\nengine, middleware and telemetry see the same IStepResult\nwhether the step came from C# or from YAML. A new step\nkind is a type registered in IStepRegistry (an IExtension):\nthe factory has no list of kinds.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "sec",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900066,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900067,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "#a7f3d0",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "x": 1440,
   "y": 420,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 117.25,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "sec_t",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900068,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900069,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "x": 1458,
   "y": 438,
   "width": 444.6,
   "height": 81.25,
   "text": "The factory knows nothing about LLMs\n\nA step names a role (profileName), never a key or an\nendpoint; the LlmStep resolves it while its configuration\nis populated, so an unknown role fails at build time.",
   "originalText": "The factory knows nothing about LLMs\n\nA step names a role (profileName), never a key or an\nendpoint; the LlmStep resolves it while its configuration\nis populated, so an unknown role fails at build time.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#065f46",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "lim",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900070,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900071,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "x": 1440,
   "y": 640,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 133.5,
   "strokeColor": "#dc2626",
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "lim_t",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900072,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900073,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "x": 1458,
   "y": 658,
   "width": 436.8,
   "height": 97.5,
   "text": "What it does not check\n\nA schema mismatch compares schema names, not shapes.\ninputSchema is checked against the pipeline input and in\ndependsOn, not at each step when it runs. nested steps\ntake no dependsOn: they run in declared order.",
   "originalText": "What it does not check\n\nA schema mismatch compares schema names, not shapes.\ninputSchema is checked against the pipeline input and in\ndependsOn, not at each step when it runs. nested steps\ntake no dependsOn: they run in declared order.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#991b1b",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "gate_h",
