   "width": 858.0,
   "height": 162.5,
   "text": "invalid YAML, or a key repeated in a mapping              Invalid YAML at line N, column M (YamlJson.cs:43,48)\nunknown document key                                      only name and steps are valid (:175)\nduplicate or missing id, id containing '/'                ids are unique across nested steps too (:230)\nunknown type / unknown property / wrong value type        the error lists the valid ones (:245, :277, :493)\nschema not registered, or step is not IJsonSchemaStep     (:551, :331)\ndependsOn missing or pointing at a nested step            (:610, :615)\nschema mismatch between dependent steps                   (:625)\ncycle                                                     Cycle detected in pipeline DAG (:653)\n\nDiscovering any of these three LLM calls in would cost money and time.",
   "originalText": "invalid YAML, or a key repeated in a mapping              Invalid YAML at line N, column M (YamlJson.cs:43,48)\nunknown document key                                      only name and steps are valid (:175)\nduplicate or missing id, id containing '/'                ids are unique across nested steps too (:230)\nunknown type / unknown property / wrong value type        the error lists the valid ones (:245, :277, :493)\nschema not registered, or step is not IJsonSchemaStep     (:551, :331)\ndependsOn missing or pointing at a nested step            (:610, :615)\nschema mismatch between dependent steps                   (:625)\ncycle                                                     Cycle detected in pipeline DAG (:653)\n\nDiscovering any of these three LLM calls in would cost money and time.",
